> From North - Follow I[-]95 South.[ Take] Exit 126.[ Go left] on Highway 9A (I-295 SE[). Take] Monument[ Road] exit[.] Turn[ right] on Monument Rd[. After 1].5[ miles, cross] Atlantic Blvd (I-10[) and go 1] more[ mile to] Live Oak Dr.[ The] church is on the left.
From South - Follow I-95 North[.] Take Exit 99[ for] Southside Blvd[. After approximately] 7[ miles,] turn[ right on] Atlantic Blvd[.] (I-10 East[). At the] second[ traffic] light[,] turn[ right on] Live Oak Dr.[ Go 1 mile, and] the church is on the left.
From West - Follow I-10 East (Atlantic Blvd)[ to the traffic] light[ at] Monument Rd. & Live Oak Dr.[ Go right] on Live Oak Dr.[ Go] 1[ mile].

